Package: OSMI
Title: One-simple missing DNA-methylation value imputation
Version: 0.99.0
Date: 2025-03-31
Authors@R: 
    person("Christelle, Lutz", "Ngueda_Kemda, Leistritz", , "Christelle.Ngueda-Kemda@med.uni-jena.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The main of this OSMI is to impute missing values 
             for methylome with the advantage of single subject application.
             beside it is possible to drive a comparison test with Two benchmark function impute.knn and methyLImp.
